## Spec inventory

States: DRAFT, QUEUED, ACTIVE, REVISED, BUILT, PARKED, CLOSED. BUILT is complete on its
branch with the close pending; PARKED is deliberately paused and unmerged, and a PARKED row
states its reason and its revisit trigger in the note. Neither is on the trunk, so a
planning precondition reads this column rather than assuming close order follows spec order.

